AUDIO: 'And now, let me share another trick to improve your image quality. Instead of using the Coin Image VAE, you can use the When 2.1 VAE 2x upscaler. And to do this, you need the ComfyUI VAE'

[07:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Utils custom node. Add the Load VAE node and the VAE Decode node from the VAE Utils. This VAE upscales the image during decoding and makes the quality much'

[07:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
